    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "Jacket design: Dmitry Krasny.\r\nOther artwork by Bonnie Scranton, Dmitry Krasny, and Weilin Wu.\r\n\r\nFew would disagree: Life in the information age can be overwhelming. Through computers, the Internet, the media, and even our daily newspapers, we are awash in a seemingly endless stream of charts, maps, infographics, diagrams, and data. Visual Explanations is a navigational guide through this turbulent sea of information. The book is an essential reference for anyone involved in graphic, web, or multimedia design, as well as for educators and lecturers who use graphics in presentations or classes."
